{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんみさみさ(*´｀*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日久しぶりに温泉に入って\nこんな時間なのに\nテンション高山なみさみさです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わ〜〜〜〜(･∀･)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/scissors.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねね・まりか・まひろと\n一緒に入ってきたよ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうな、久しぶりすぎて\n本当気持ちよかった〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大分は温泉がいっぱいあるから\n大分に居た頃は\nかなりの頻度で行ってて\n学校帰りに友達と入って\n帰ったりする日も\n珍しくありませんでした(^-^)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"26日の【風呂の日】は\n安くなるので毎月行ってたよ。\n学生に優しい〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/scissors.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさの生活の中に\n温泉は必要不可欠(´_ゝ｀)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/shine.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だったから、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"上京してから一回も\n行けてなかったから\n今日行けて本当嬉しかったよー泣\nんーもう温泉大好きっ♪♪\nサウナも岩盤浴も好き♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"冬は体の芯から冷えるし\nみなさんも時間あったときは\n温泉行って暖まってね〜？\n東京でおすすめの温泉\n知っている方！おったら\n教えてください(･v･)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また行きたいなーっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして今日は撮影でした！\nみんなと"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/shine.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誰が写ってるカナ？？♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/27/img_0445.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今は ねねと同じ部屋"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/fullmoon.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ﾟ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さっきまで話しよったに\nもう寝たみたい(´･ω･｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小さくて布団の中に\nちょこん♪って感じに\n収まってて可愛いんです！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさ背が高いから\n小さい子見ると\n可愛いなーって思う(´_ゝ｀)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだか\n守ってあげたくなるよね！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はお香をたいて寝ます♪\n最近買ったばかりの\nバニラの香り...(*´｀*)\n落ち着くー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"部屋中が\nいい香りになったところで\nみさも寝るとします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだかゆっくり眠れそう♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/27/img_5760.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねねちゃん前向いて〜(><)\nじゃあまた明日"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も最後まで読んでくれて\nありがとうございました♪\nみなさんおやすみ〜(^-^)"}],"source":"archive"}